---
title: "end (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: caller check
    q_check_auth --> q_check_ended: caller is legionOperator or projectAdmin
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized caller
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_ended --> q_set_end: hasEnded == false
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_already: hasEnded == true
    q_revert_already --> [*]: revert AlreadyEnded
    q_set_end --> q_calc_refund: hasEnded = true, endTime = block.timestamp
    q_calc_refund --> [*]: refundEndTime = endTime + refundPeriodSeconds, emit SaleEnded

    note right of q_set_end
        INV-001: endTime is set exactly once
        INV-002: refundEndTime = endTime + refundPeriodSeconds
        INV-003: no new investments accepted after hasEnded = true
    end note
